sequenceDiagram
    actor Cajero
    participant UI as Renderer UI
    participant PL as Preload
    participant IPC as IPC Handlers
    participant AuthCtrl as AuthController
    participant SaleSvc as SaleService
    participant DB as SQLite

    Note over Cajero,DB: 🔐 LOGIN
    Cajero->>UI: pedro_molina / pedro123
    UI->>PL: api.auth.login({username, password})
    PL->>IPC: ipcRenderer.invoke('login', creds)
    IPC->>AuthCtrl: login(creds)
    AuthCtrl->>DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE username=? AND is_active=1
    DB-->>AuthCtrl: user (password_hash, role_id)
    AuthCtrl->>AuthCtrl: bcrypt.compare(password, hash)
    AuthCtrl->>DB: SELECT codename FROM role_permissions WHERE role_id=?
    DB-->>AuthCtrl: [dashboard.view, products.read, sales.pos, ...]
    AuthCtrl-->>IPC: {success, user: {id, name, role_id, permissions}}
    IPC-->>PL: result
    PL-->>UI: result
    UI->>UI: sessionStorage: user + permissions

    Note over Cajero,DB: VENTA (POS)
    Cajero->>UI: Selecciona productos
    UI->>PL: api.sale.create(items, payment, client, user_id)
    PL->>IPC: ipcRenderer.invoke('sale:create', data)
    IPC->>IPC: hasPermission(user_id, 'sales.pos')
    IPC->>SaleSvc: createSale(data)
    SaleSvc->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    SaleSvc->>DB: INSERT INTO sales (invoice_number, total, user_id)
    loop Por cada item
        SaleSvc->>DB: SELECT stock FROM products WHERE id=?
        SaleSvc->>SaleSvc: Validar stock >= quantity
        SaleSvc->>DB: INSERT INTO sale_items (...)
        SaleSvc->>DB: UPDATE products SET stock = stock - quantity
        SaleSvc->>DB: INSERT INTO inventory_logs (change_amount, user_id)
    end
    SaleSvc-->>DB: COMMIT
    SaleSvc-->>IPC: {success, saleId, invoiceNumber, total}
    IPC-->>PL: result
    PL-->>UI: result
    UI->>UI: Mostrar comprobante

    Note over Cajero,DB: ANULACION DE VENTA
    Cajero->>UI: Botón Anular
    UI->>PL: api.sale.delete(id, userId)
    PL->>IPC: ipcRenderer.invoke('sale:delete', {id, userId})
    IPC->>IPC: hasPermission(userId, 'sales.delete')
    alt Tiene permiso sales.delete
        IPC->>SaleSvc: deleteSale(id, userId)
        SaleSvc->>DB: SELECT * FROM sale_items WHERE sale_id=?
        SaleSvc->>DB: DELETE FROM sales WHERE id=?
        loop Por cada item devuelto
            SaleSvc->>DB: UPDATE products SET stock = stock + quantity
            SaleSvc->>DB: INSERT INTO inventory_logs (ANULACION, user_id)
        end
        SaleSvc-->>IPC: {success, message}
        IPC-->>UI: Venta anulada y stock devuelto
    else Sin permiso
        IPC-->>UI: ACCESO DENEGADO
    end